      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The struggle to maintain a sense of self when the world turns against you is exhausting, and it’s natural to question the value of that fight. But your worth isn't tied to your job or the opinions of strangers in a grocery aisle. If the cost of being good feels too high right now, perhaps you can redefine what \"good\" means for yourself in this immediate, quiet moment. Just focus on the next small thing that lets you feel a tiny bit less like a failure.",
