      "content": "it's hard to focus on \"tiny things\" when everything feels so permanent. like, i look at the world and it just feels broken and cold. i tried to be better, to do the right thing, and it literally ruined my life. i'm just so tired of fighting a losing battle. sometimes i think the only way to actually stop the weight from crushing me is to just... not be here anymore. it seems like the only way to get any peace from all this.",
